	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AT7w23tpDH4aIbQbm",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 21, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 12, HP 18, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 9, DODGE 9, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AvcY7IzhQ_F_M-ZdM",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 40 (offense 26, protection 14), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "AOeb6M6rQBpBc1R6Y",
			"text": "Black Cloud (1d toxic), reach 2 yards: By spending 2 FP and performing a Ready maneuver, an achaierai can release a choking, toxic black cloud. It spreads in a 2-yard radius area around the achaierai, lasts 10 seconds, and drifts with the wind. The cloud imposes a -3 penalty on all vision- and Infravision-based rolls within the area. Additionally, every creature that inhales the cloud must make an HT roll. If it fails, it takes 1d toxic damage, ignoring DR, and begins to hallucinate for margin of failure minutes. After that the subject is stunned (p. B420) and may roll vs. HT once per second to recover. Achaierais are immune to this ability."
		},
		{
			"id": "ACpJmz5kDfaYzOW4R",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/achaierai.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "AjV9_-6jd7WSdS9Iy",
			"text": "Source template total: 213 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "A2txyDr8g1nRLTP2I",
			"text": "Library-rebuilt template total: 213 points."
		},
		{
			"id": "A7Q_Fohj8aOdQBb3i",
			"text": "CER was computed from parsed Typical Stats using the Dungeons On Automatic baseline CER path."
		},
		{
			"id": "ACcVdapBuH_cOVcUK",
			"text": "Review attacks, special abilities, encounter frequency, treasure, grappling, and GCS modifiers before approval."
		},
		{
			"id": "AO46ObgWuBQ52YfzM",
			"text": "Size 4 hexes; Weight 750 lbs."
		},
		{
			"id": "Angob2HgffzH8861f",
			"text": "Original GURPS conversion by Enraged Eggplant, from Monsters (May 11, 2024); adapted and republished with permission."
